{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0<strong>Age of Enchantment</strong>, a fusion of tower defense, deckbuilding, and D&amp;D that you've always been waiting for.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Defense + Deckbuilding + D&amp;D</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Artifact System</strong></i>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Artifacts by leveling up or finding them in game and purchasing them with<strong> Essence.</strong>\u00a0Then, you can set these in your loadout to help you maximize your build and find the strongest synergies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Class-Inspired Towers</strong></i>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your towers take the form of classes from D&amp;D. Start the game with the Fighter and Wizard, and unlock the Paladin, Cleric, Barbarian, and Warlock as you level up.\u00a0Each tower has 3 different upgrade paths with 3 tiers level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046020/extras/d3b19738d0ce1fc498091b9844b1e685.poster.avif?t=1771858064\" width=1170 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046020/extras/d3b19738d0ce1fc498091b9844b1e685.webm?t=1771858064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046020/extras/d3b19738d0ce1fc498091b9844b1e685.mp4?t=1771858064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighter</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duelist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polearm Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great Weapon Master</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning Mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Mastery</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleric</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domain of Light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domain of War</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Domain of Peace</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paladin</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Templar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield Master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspiring Leader</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warlock</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex of Weakness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex of Soul Leech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex of Withering</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barbarian</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zealot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm Herald</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berserker</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046020/extras/9589ac6f4bdcd71d6c9daa7020c4e7d8.poster.avif?t=1771858064\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046020/extras/9589ac6f4bdcd71d6c9daa7020c4e7d8.webm?t=1771858064\" type=\"video/webm; 